@startuml

start

:Avionics stack (FMS/FADEC) operates on deterministic RTOS;

:Pre-flight mission scheduling sequence managed by high-priority supervisory task;
:Execute conditional state machine;

if (Weather  conditions suitable?) then (yes)
  if (Aircraft status nominal?) then (yes)
    if (Fuel reserves adequate?) then (yes)
      if (Flight plan validated?) then (yes)
        if (Crew health confirmed?) then (yes)
          if (Airspace permit granted?) then (yes)
            :Fork into concurrent operations;
            fork
